        node: "8-3-8",
        en: "THE FLAG ON CZECH p.192 IS CORRECT, AND LEHNINGER SETTLES IT — BUT NOT IN CHAPTER 10, AND THAT DISTINCTION IS PART OF THE ANSWER. Czech node 8-3-8 records, checked against the scan on 2026-08-14 and flagged rather than corrected, that the book's own p.192 figure runs a right-hand column geranyl-PP to geranylgeranyl-PP to phytoene, making GGPP the product of ONE head-to-tail condensation from geranyl-PP. The node's objection is arithmetic and it is right: C10 plus C5 is C15, not C20. FIRST, LEHNINGER CHAPTER 10 DOES NOT SETTLE THIS, and saying so is the honest half of the answer. Chapter 10 states only that “ The sterols of all eukaryotes are synthesized from simple five-carbon isoprene subunits, as are the fat-soluble vitamins, quinones, and dolichols ” (A p.352) and gathers the whole family again on A p.360, deferring the pathway to chapter 21 both times. No condensation series appears anywhere in chapter 10. SECOND, CHAPTER 21 SETTLES IT TWICE, and both places were read directly in A for this note. In the running text of section 21.4: isopentenyl pyrophosphate and dimethylallyl pyrophosphate undergo a head-to-tail condensation forming the 10-carbon geranyl pyrophosphate; “ Geranyl pyrophosphate undergoes another head-to-tail condensation with isopentenyl pyrophosphate, yielding the 15-carbon intermediate farnesyl pyrophosphate ” ; and two farnesyl pyrophosphate join head to head to give squalene (A p.774). And in the printed pathway of chapter 21's own Data Analysis Problem, the series is set out with every carbon count on the page: IPP, then DMAPP, then Geranyl pyrophosphate (C10), then Farnesyl pyrophosphate (C15), then Geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate (C20), then Phytoene (C40), then lycopene and beta-carotene — each step adding one IPP until the last, where two geranylgeranyl pyrophosphates are linked to form phytoene (A p.792). So GGPP is FPP plus IPP, exactly as the flag says, and phytoene is two GGPP, which the Czech figure also has right. THIRD, AND THE MOST USEFUL PART: THE CZECH BOOK CONTRADICTS ITSELF RATHER THAN BEING UNIFORMLY WRONG. Its own p.183 diagram, recorded in node 8-2-4-1, gives farnesyl-PP plus IPP to digeranyl-PP (C20) and two digeranyl-PP to phytoene — which is the correct series under a different name for the same C20 compound. WHAT TO SAY IN AN EXAM: give the series as IPP and DMAPP to geranyl-PP (C10), plus IPP to farnesyl-PP (C15), plus IPP to geranylgeranyl or digeranyl-PP (C20), two farnesyl-PP head to head to squalene (C30), two C20 head to head to phytoene (C40). That answer matches Lehninger and matches the Czech book's own p.183; only p.192's figure disagrees, and if asked to reproduce THAT figure, reproduce it and say which step does not balance.",
        cn: "**捷克教材第 192 页上的那处标记是对的，而 Lehninger 把它裁定了——但不是在第 10 章裁定的，而这个区别本身就是答案的一部分。** 捷克节点 `8-3-8` 记录（2026-08-14 对照扫描件核对过，并且是标记而非改写）：**教材自己 p.192 的图，右侧一列跑的是 geranyl-PP → geranylgeranyl-PP → phytoene**，**等于把 GGPP 当成 geranyl-PP 一步头尾缩合的产物**。**该节点的反对意见是算术上的，而且它是对的**：**C10 + C5 = C15，不是 C20**。 **第一，Lehninger 第 10 章并不能裁定这件事——把这点说出来，是答案里诚实的那一半。** 第 10 章只说：**「所有真核生物的固醇，都由简单的五碳异戊二烯亚单元合成，脂溶性维生素、醌类和 dolichol 也是如此」**（A 第 352 页），并在 A 第 360 页再次把这一整个家族收在一起；**两处都把通路推给第 21 章**。**整个第 10 章里没有出现任何缩合序列。** **第二，第 21 章裁定了两次**，而**这两处都为写这条注释在 A 里直接读过**。**21.4 节的正文里**：isopentenyl pyrophosphate 与 dimethylallyl pyrophosphate 进行头尾缩合，形成十碳的 geranyl pyrophosphate；**「Geranyl pyrophosphate 再与 isopentenyl pyrophosphate 进行一次头尾缩合，产生十五碳的中间物 farnesyl pyrophosphate」**；**随后两个 farnesyl pyrophosphate 头对头结合，生成 squalene**（A 第 774 页）。**而在第 21 章自己的 Data Analysis Problem 里，那条通路被印在纸面上，每一步的碳数都标着**：**IPP → DMAPP → Geranyl pyrophosphate (C10) → Farnesyl pyrophosphate (C15) → Geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate (C20) → Phytoene (C40) → lycopene → β-carotene**——**每一步加一个 IPP，直到最后一步：两个 geranylgeranyl pyrophosphate 连起来形成 phytoene**（A 第 792 页）。**所以 GGPP 就是 FPP + IPP，与那条标记说的一模一样**；**而 phytoene 是两个 GGPP，这一点捷克那张图也是对的**。 **第三，也是最有用的一点：捷克教材是自相矛盾，而不是通篇都错。** **它自己 p.183 上的图（记录在节点 `8-2-4-1` 里）给的是：farnesyl-PP + IPP → digeranyl-PP (C20)，两个 digeranyl-PP → phytoene**——**这正是正确的序列，只是同一个 C20 化合物换了个名字**。 **考试里该怎么答**：**把序列给成 IPP 与 DMAPP → geranyl-PP (C10)，再加 IPP → farnesyl-PP (C15)，再加 IPP → geranylgeranyl-PP（或 digeranyl-PP，C20）；两个 farnesyl-PP 头对头 → squalene (C30)；两个 C20 头对头 → phytoene (C40)。** **这个答案既符合 Lehninger，也符合捷克教材自己的 p.183**；**只有 p.192 那张图不一致**——**如果被要求复现「那张图」，就照画，并指出哪一步账对不上。**"
